    "tpc_book": "<div>Robert H. Shumway and David S. Stoffer, Time Series Analysis and Its Applications: With R Examples (Softcover, 19 April 2017). ISBN: 978-3-319-52451-1.</div>\n",
    "tpc_book_en": "<div>Robert H. Shumway and David S. Stoffer, Time Series Analysis and Its Applications: With R Examples (Softcover, 19 April 2017). ISBN: 978-3-319-52451-1.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Chatfield, Chris, and Haipeng Xing.&nbsp;<em>The analysis of time series: an introduction with R</em>. CRC press, 2019.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Goodman, Victor, and Joseph Stampfli. &quot;The mathematics of finance.&quot;&nbsp;<em>American Mathematical Society</em>&nbsp;(2001).</div>\n"
